lt":false,"description":"Pull requests that update php code","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":12376479848,"node_id":"LA_kwDOUEWha88AAAAC4bIYaA","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/datagen24/victual/labels/Medium","name":"Medium","color":"fbca04","default":false,"description":"Medium Priority","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":2,"created_at":"2026-10-13T00:57:15Z","updated_at":"2026-10-13T21:49:30Z","closed_at":"2026-10-13T21:49:30Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"OWNER","active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"When products with different stock units are merged and the kept product already has its own conversion for the removed product's stock unit, stock and the repointed consumption rows end up on different factors.\n\n## Where\n\n- `services/StockService.php`: `MergeProducts()`, `$factor` from `cache__quantity_unit_conversions_resolved` (removed product's conversion), then the conversion dedupe (\"kept factor wins\")\n\n## Evidence\n\n`MergeProducts` rescales stock and stock_log by the removed product's factor A→B (for example 30). If the kept product already defines A→B (for example 25), dedupe keeps 25. After PR #880, recipe lines and mappings with their own unit A are repointed, not rescaled, and convert later at the kept factor.\n\n## Failure scenario\n\nThe removed product had 1 box = 30 tablets; the kept product says 1 box = 25. Ledger amounts are rescaled at 30. A repointed consumption recipe line of \"1 box\" now books 25 stock units, not 30.\n\n## Possible direction\n\nRefuse the merge when the two products disagree on a conversion that rescaled rows depend on, or let the operator choose the factor and apply it everywhere.\n\n## How this was found\n\nReported by an independent validator during the 2026-10-12 audit remediation (issues #846–#868), while it reviewed PR #880 (#848). Pre-existing behaviour that #880 makes visible.\n","closed_by":{"login":"datagen24","id":20876965,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIwODc2OTY1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/20876965?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/datagen24","html_url":"https://github.com/datagen24","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/datagen24/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/datagen24/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/datagen24/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/datagen24/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/datagen24/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/datagen24/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/datagen24/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/datagen24/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/datagen24/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/datagen24/victual/issues/901/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/datagen24/victual/issues/901/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed","pinned_comment":null}
